the colon--a rare case report</article-title><source>J Formos Med Assoc</source><year>2007</year><volume>106()</volume><issue>2 Suppl</issue><fpage>S32</fpage><lpage>S36</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">17493894</pub-id></element-citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>